fields.value:
{{Breaknotes
| name = Fervor
| desc = Disables the stack buff gain, as well as the attack speed bonus of already existing stacks.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Fervor icon0}}
| desc = With each continuous blow on the same target, Troll gains increased attack speed.  If Troll changes targets, the stacks drop to zero.
}}
* Grants up to {{calc|v1*{{#var:Fervor value1}}|v1={{#var:Fervor value2}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t2r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Fervor value1}}|v1={{#var:Fervor value2 tal}}}}|15tal}}) {{M|attack speed}} bonus.

* {{cf|shdnotes}} The {{M|Aghanim's Shard|text=ability upgrade}} has the additional properties:
** For heroes with 0-attack {{M|projectile speed}}, the {{M|instant attack}} component does nothing unless the attacking hero is near the attacked target.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** Increases {{M|attack damage}} by an average of {{Code|{{ValueColor||{{#var:Fervor type1 value1 shd}}|shd|x}} + {{ValueColor||{{#var:Fervor type1 value2 shd}}|shd|x}} × f(Stack)}}.
*** For {{M|melee}} units, if the enemy target is {{G|melee miss range}} range farther than the attacker's range, the attack will {{M|miss}} regardless.

